            <div class="bg-gray-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border border-gray-100">
              <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">What humidity should I set my basement dehumidifier to?</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-700 text-sm leading-relaxed">
                Fifty percent relative humidity is the standard target. Below that, mold and dust mites cannot establish, and going lower costs disproportionately more electricity without additional benefit. Verify with a separate hygrometer placed across the room, since built-in sensors sit near the unit exhaust and can read several points off.
